        "Every composite elapsed sample (166,229.4 to 168,003.0 ms) is below every persistent sample (190,397.9 to 205,292.3 ms).",
        "Both modes retain median 124 completed callbacks/submissions, 121 trusted inputs and median 120 texture uploads. Individual uploads range 118 to 121 for persistent and 119 to 120 for composite.",
        "Renderer-thread CPU decreased 0.135%; task time decreased 0.776%. This is a wall-time improvement with essentially unchanged measured renderer-thread work.",
        "Input-to-completed-callback p95 median decreased from 1,750.2 to 1,463.8 ms. This association is not a physical presentation or input-to-new-pixels measurement.",
        "All six primary trials retain 14,380 changed selection pixels against the existing minimum 50-pixel gate, then restore document and rulers exactly.",
        "Separate diagnostic passes paint no Document, Ruler or Navigator work. Interaction paints are 119 persistent and 120 composite; no primary timing includes managed diagnostic instrumentation.",
        "All nine timing-state native pixel pairs pass the unchanged luma 12 / 0.001 gate. Broader d0 AOT Welcome lifecycle quality is recorded separately.",
        "Post-window capture/validation takes 142.5 to 154.4 ms; restore validation takes 2.752 to 5.435 seconds. These are separate automation/image-analysis durations, not matched queue-drain or presentation measurements.",
        "The comparison does not prove same-runner recovery relative to the 96e regression baseline; independent jobs cannot be multiplied into a baseline claim.",
